  "headings": [],
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "html",
      "html": "<p>Make your own report form so the fields match what your team actually needs to send.</p>"
    },
    {
      "type": "slideset",
      "source": "canonical",
      "slides": [
        {
          "title": "Open the Editor",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<p>From the Reports Panel, tap <strong>Editor</strong>. This opens a new blank template you can build from scratch.</p>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/9d58fe854259f743.webp",
              "width": 422,
              "height": 51
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Start a blank template",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<p>The blank template starts with a title and a <strong>+</strong> button. Tap <strong>+</strong> to add your first field.</p>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/47198f8f30669ace.webp",
              "width": 800,
              "height": 297
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Pick a field type",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<p>Choose the field type you need from the list, for example <strong>Section</strong>, <strong>Text Field</strong>, <strong>Location Field</strong> or <strong>Dropdown List(Single Selection)</strong>.</p>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/369bee9569c31724.webp",
              "width": 693,
              "height": 752
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Add and arrange fields",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<p>Each field gets a <strong>Field Title</strong> and a <strong>Required</strong> toggle. Tap <strong>+</strong> again to keep adding fields until the report is complete.</p>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/5f44caa28e2bb318.webp",
              "width": 800,
              "height": 387
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Save, export or import",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<p>Tap the three-dot menu, then:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Save Template</strong> to store it for use</li>\n<li><strong>Export Template</strong> to share it as an XML file</li>\n<li><strong>Import Template</strong> to load an XML template someone sent you</li>\n</ul>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/5ec261548ffe0e93.webp",
              "width": 800,
              "height": 654
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
